{"id":"d2cd0932b46dd73f","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-strong-definition-pullback.md","title":"Strong Definition Allows Formula Pullback","display":"thm-strong-definition-pullback — Strong Definition Allows Formula Pullback","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-strong-definition-pullback","aliases":["92-thm-strong-definition-pullback"],"display":"thm-strong-definition-pullback — Strong Definition Allows Formula Pullback","source":"第 VIII 章 pp. 99–100，Theorem 2（PDF 116–117）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-strongly-definable-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-strong-definition-pullback"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-strong-definition-pullback</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-strong-definition-pullback — Strong Definition Allows Formula Pullback"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VIII 章 pp. 99–100，Theorem 2（PDF 116–117）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"be5eece035332f0c\" href=\"?note=be5eece035332f0c\" title=\"92-df-strongly-definable-function\">92-df-strongly-definable-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongDef}_{\\mathcal S}(F,f)\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongDef}_{\\mathcal S}(F,f)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(K\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(K)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(K)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=\\exists v_1(F\\land\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(K;v_1))\">\\(H=\\exists v_1(F\\land\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(K;v_1))\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}strong\\text{-}definition\\text{-}pullback}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StrongDef}_{\\mathcal S}(F,f)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(H;\\bar n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(K;\\overline{f(n)})\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}strong\\text{-}definition\\text{-}pullback}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StrongDef}_{\\mathcal S}(F,f)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(H;\\bar n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(K;\\overline{f(n)})\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=f(n)\">\\(m=f(n)\\)</span>。由正图实例，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(\\bar m)\">\\(K(\\bar m)\\)</span> 推出存在见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar m\">\\(\\bar m\\)</span>，故推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H(\\bar n)\">\\(H(\\bar n)\\)</span>。由强唯一性，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(\\bar n,y)\">\\(F(\\bar n,y)\\)</span> 推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=\\bar m\">\\(y=\\bar m\\)</span>；等式代入使任何 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(\\bar n,y)\\land K(y)\">\\(F(\\bar n,y)\\land K(y)\\)</span> 推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(\\bar m)\">\\(K(\\bar m)\\)</span>，再消去存在量词即可。只在 Remark 的证明说明中采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(\\bar m)\">\\(K(\\bar m)\\)</span> 简记，Assertion 用已定义实例构造器。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VIII 章 pp. 99–100，Theorem 2（PDF 116–117）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-strongly-definable-function","status":"resolved","id":"be5eece035332f0c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-strongly-definable-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrongDef}_{\\mathcal S}(F,f)","display":false},{"tex":"K\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(K)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"H=\\exists v_1(F\\land\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(K;v_1))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}strong\\text{-}definition\\text{-}pullback}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StrongDef}_{\\mathcal S}(F,f)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(H;\\bar n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(K;\\overline{f(n)})\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"m=f(n)","display":false},{"tex":"K(\\bar m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar m","display":false},{"tex":"H(\\bar n)","display":false},{"tex":"F(\\bar n,y)","display":false},{"tex":"y=\\bar m","display":false},{"tex":"F(\\bar n,y)\\land K(y)","display":false},{"tex":"K(\\bar m)","display":false},{"tex":"K(\\bar m)","display":false}],"bytes":1584,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-strongly-definable-function]] → [[92-thm-strong-definition-pullback]]；[[92-lem-weak-to-strong-function-definition]]利用有限序性质强化函数图定义。强可定义性对每个固定数码输入约束所有输出，不等于一个统一内部总性句。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-324","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-strong-definition-pullback]]"}],"outgoing":["be5eece035332f0c"]}